---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";


---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Barepics">
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
			<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white mb-4 tracking-tighter">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="text-lg text-brand mb-16 font-medium">Last Updated: <span id="current-date">May 2026</span></p>

			<section class="text-gray-300 text-lg prose prose-invert lg:prose-xl">
				<h2 class="mt-0!">1. Introduction</h2>
				<p>
					Barepics respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data. This
					Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you use our
					mobile application and website.
				</p>

				<h2>2. Age Restriction (COPPA Compliance)</h2>
				<p>
					<strong class="text-white">Barepics is strictly for individuals aged 18 and older.</strong> We do not knowingly
					collect, request, or maintain personal information from anyone under the age of 18. If we
					become aware that we have collected personal information from a minor, we will take
					immediate steps to delete such information from our records.
				</p>

				<h2>3. Information We Collect</h2>
				<p>
					As a content aggregator, we strive to collect the absolute minimum amount of personal data
					necessary for the App to function. We may collect:
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li>
						<strong class="text-white">Usage Data:</strong> Information such as your device type, operating system, IP
						address, and app activity (e.g., categories viewed) to help us improve performance and
						stability.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong class="text-white">Advertising Data:</strong> We partner with third-party ad networks. These networks
						may collect anonymous identifiers and interactions to serve relevant advertisements.
					</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>4. Third-Party Advertising & Cookies</h2>
				<p>
					Barepics uses third-party advertising partners (such as ExoClick) to monetize the App. These
					third parties may use cookies, web beacons, and similar tracking technologies to collect
					information about your activities on this and other apps and websites to provide you
					targeted advertising based upon your interests. Barepics does not control these third-party
					tracking technologies.
				</p>

				<h2>5. How We Use Your Information</h2>
				<p>We use the minimal data collected to:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Provide, operate, and maintain our App.</li>
					<li>Analyze usage trends to improve the user interface and content delivery.</li>
					<li>Serve contextual and targeted advertisements to keep the App free.</li>
					<li>Detect, prevent, and address technical issues or fraudulent activity.</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>6. Data Security</h2>
				<p>
					We use commercially reasonable security measures to protect the integrity of our App.
					However, no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure.
					We cannot guarantee its absolute security and assume no liability for data breaches
					resulting from unauthorized third-party access.
				</p>

				<h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
				<p>
					We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by
					posting the new Privacy Policy on this page. You are advised to review this Privacy Policy
					periodically for any changes.
				</p>
			</section>
		</main>
</Layout>

